---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Image1 from '../images/corporate-1.jpg';
import BookingButtons from '../components/BookingButtons.astro';

---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Corporate Events | Northumberland Sporting Clays"
  description="Events for your team"
>

<section>

  <header class="section-header">
    <span class="section-eyebrow">Team Building</span>
    <h1>Corporate Events</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="prose-container">
    <p>Clay pigeon shooting is great for corporate days out. </p>
    <p>It provides an ideal team building exercise or the perfect thank you present for staff and clients.  Lunches and afternoon teas can be pre-booked and enjoyed in our cosy and warm 'Bothy'.</p>
    <p>Clients had this to say about their experience:</p>
    <blockquote>“The best experience we have had in ages.”</blockquote>
    <blockquote>“We had a brilliant tutor, kind, patient and very good. The cake was also delicious - a fabulous time!”</blockquote>
    <blockquote>“Can't wait to come back and try again.”</blockquote>
  </div>

  <Image src={Image1} alt="Corporate event at Northumberland Sporting Clays" height="400" width="600" class="wide-image" />

  <div class="prose-container">
    <h2>How to Book</h2>
    <p>Please contact us to arrange your day out.</p>
    <BookingButtons />
  </div>

</section>

</BaseLayout>